Let me reconsider the logic in `print_sep_string`. Looking at the code again:

```c
while (l-- > 0)
{
    if (*s == ' ')
    {
        s++;
        ++spaces_not_printed;
    }
    else
    {
        if (spaces_not_printed > 0)
            print_white_space ();
        putchar (*s++);
        ++output_position;
    }
}
```

